msgid "If your school uses Google Apps, you can enable single sign on and calendar integration with TawasulOS. This process makes use of Google's APIs, and allows a user to access TawasulOS without a username and password, provided that their listed email address is a Google account to which they have access. For configuration instructions, %1$sclick here%2$s."
